y is unavailable, the report specifies the fallback approach (e.g., self-provisioned Prometheus/Loki for the Dev Preview) and its implications.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- [P0] Observability metrics functional: token usage, rate limiting enforcement, API key lifecycle events (per Staff Engineer Input) — prerequisite validation\n- [P1] Observability logging functional: authentication events, rate limit enforcement, subscription selection (per Staff Engineer Input) — prerequisite validation\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":52590,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ab07d7148cbf06fc","agent_id":"a5dd9ebccf03d402c","session_id":"382ccfe0-6ddd-4feb-9959-cd45ee4b4e7a","uuid":"3628b7d1-e31b-48bb-8e6c-c7b2c4f91f6c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T11:54:56.217Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8003"}
