{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-99bdf8a470307bb1","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8003-BRANCH-C-E012\n3\ttitle: 'Contingency: direct Envoy ext_authz authentication and rate limiting for MaaS\n4\t  on xKS'\n5\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8003\n6\tcomponent: Model as a Service\n7\tteam: MaaS\n8\ttype: Implementation\n9\tpriority: P0\n10\tbranch: C\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-8003-E001\n12\tdependencies:\n13\t- RHAISTRAT-8003-E001\n14\t- RHAISTRAT-8003-E004\n15\tgate_failure_impact:\n16\t  action: rewrite\n17\t  fallback_approach: This branch exists only for outcome C (Kuadrant not installable\n18\t    on xKS). If the investigation resolves to outcome A (RHCL Helm) or B (standalone\n19\t    Authorino + Limitador), this branch is not needed and the Authorino-based main-plan\n20\t    authentication path applies.\n21\tai_signals:\n22\t  change_specificity: 0\n23\t  pattern_precedent: 0\n24\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n25\t  existing_foundation: 0\n26\t  open_questions: -1\n27\t  external_dependency: 0\n28\t  human_process_gates: 0\n29\t  repo_access: 1\n30\t  architecture_claims: 0\n31\timplementation_type: null\n32\tinvestigation_signals: null\n33\tai_implementability: Medium\n34\tai_implementability_score: 0\n35\tjira_key: null\n36\t---\n37\t# Contingency: Direct Envoy ext_authz Authentication and Rate Limiting for MaaS on xKS\n38\t\n39\t## Description\n40\t\n41\tContingency implementation activated only if the RHCL/Kuadrant xKS deployment path investigation resolves to outcome C — Kuadrant (Authorino + Limitador) cannot be deployed on xKS. Replaces the Authorino-based authentication enforcement with direct Envoy ext_authz integration for MaaS authentication and rate limiting, preserving the external OIDC authentication and API key validation capabilities required by the strategy.\n42\t\n43\t## Scope\n44\t\n45\t- Wire Envoy ext_authz at the MaaS gateway to perform bearer-token authentication (external OIDC JWT validation and API key validation via the maas-api callback endpoint) in place of Kuadrant/Authorino AuthPolicy enforcement.\n46\t- Provide token rate limiting equivalent to the Limitador-backed TokenRateLimitPolicy behavior (HTTP 429 on exceeded quota), using an Envoy-compatible rate limiting mechanism.\n47\t- Integrate with the Helm-based MaaS xKS installation so the contingency path is selectable via chart configuration.\n48\t- Preserve the strategy's failure-mode behavior: API key requests continue to succeed during IdP unavailability (OIDC-authenticated requests fail with HTTP 503); rate limiting enforcement unavailability denies requests with HTTP 503.\n49\t\n50\t## Acceptance Criteria\n51\t\n52\t- Given an xKS cluster where Kuadrant cannot be installed, when MaaS is deployed with the Envoy ext_authz authentication configuration, then OIDC JWT authentication and API key (`sk-oai-*`) authentication both succeed, measured by successful authenticated inference requests.\n53\t- Given token rate limits configured, when a user exceeds the rate limit, then HTTP 429 is returned, measured by monitoring response status codes.\n54\t- Given the authentication service becomes unavailable, when a user makes an inference request, then the request is denied with HTTP 503, measured by response status and Envoy logs showing upstream connection failure.\n55\t\n56\t## HLR Traceability\n57\t\n58\t- [P0] External OIDC authentication validated for user identity (contingency path)\n59\t- [P0] API key authentication (sk-oai-* flow) functional on xKS (contingency path)\n60\t- [P0] Token rate limiting functional on xKS (contingency path)\n61\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bd63816c50a5c19d","agent_id":"a76fca4762e0936a0","session_id":"382ccfe0-6ddd-4feb-9959-cd45ee4b4e7a","uuid":"56932b18-b980-465f-8721-1805cb50b8fa","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:46:52.238Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-99bdf8a470307bb1","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Final review RHAISTRAT-8003"}
